l,"uploader":{"login":"ccmywish","id":63459097,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzNDU5MDk3","gravatar_id":"","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/octet-stream","state":"uploaded","size":84300,"digest":"sha256:2dfb18f6841e595d6373e0084f8167781752de0df977fe51d84eb264c6dfed0e","download_count":15,"created_at":"2026-08-22T13:37:06Z","updated_at":"2026-08-22T13:37:07Z"}],"body":"该附件二进制文件为预编译供用户直接使用\r\n\r\n版本：`v0.2.7`\r\n日期：2026-08-22\r\n更新：https://github.com/RubyMetric/chsrc/compare/v0.2.6...v0.2.7\r\n内容：\r\n\r\n1. 重新定义 `combo dish` 的概念与完整支持\r\n    - 不再由维护者自定义 `_setsrc()`，而由框架提供核心流程\r\n    - 纠正对多同一文件的多次修改备份\r\n2. 对内（代码）对外（用户）完全修订术语，统一 \"餐厅比喻\"\r\n3. 强化对 `user define` 的能力检测\r\n4. 维护者身份称呼变化\r\n5. 试验性增加 `TOML` 的部分解析能力\r\n6. 在 Windows 上 `Release Mode` 下均会编译图标\r\n\r\n换源方法(recipe):\r\n1. `uv` 现在能够对 `python-install-mirror` 进行换源\r\n2. 增加对 `deb-src.list` 的换源\r\n\r\n源：\r\n1. `PyPI`: 修复上交源与清华源\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n## 新贡献者\r\n* @daocoder2 made their first contribution in https://github.com/RubyMetric/chsrc/pull/376","mentions_count":1}
